  "notes": "{動|うご}かす is a transitive godan verb meaning \"to move something\" or \"to operate.\"\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{動|うご}く→動く：00904_ugoku⟧ (intransitive - to move)\n\nUSAGE:\n1. To move/shift: ⟦{机|つくえ}→机：00762_tsukue⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{動|うご}かす (to move a desk)\n2. To operate: ⟦{機械|きかい}→機械：02366_kikai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{動|うご}かす (to operate a machine)\n3. To affect emotionally: ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{動|うご}かす (to move someone's heart)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{体|からだ}→体：00784_karada⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{動|うご}かす: to exercise (move one's body)\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{動|うご}かされる: to be moved (emotionally)\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{動|うご}かす: to get to work (move one's hands)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{動|うご}かして⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: is moving (something) / is operating",
